{"id": "DelhST6SPPT", "title": "Video by devanshu.motion", "description": "Devi Mahatmya mein kahani Raktabeej ke vadh par khatam hoti hai, aur wahan Maa ki jeebh isliye bahar thi taaki uske khoon ki ek bhi boond zameen par na gire. Shiv ji ke upar pair padne wala hissa Bengal aur Odisha ki lok katha se hai, aur usi ke kai roop sunne ko milte hain. Part 2 isiliye \"Kehte hain\" se shuru hota hai.\n \nNavdurga, Day 7, Part 2 of 3. Part 3 tells the granth version, from the Devi Mahatmya.\n\nEvery puppet, every stomp and every camera shake is animated frame by frame. Lamp light, sticks and all.\n\nSend this to the one person who can calm you down 🖤\n\nHappy Navratri 🙏\n\n#navratri2026 #maakalaratri #maakali #mahadev #indianart", "channel": "devanshu.motion", "uploader_id": "25176808901", "uploader": "Devanshu Singhai", "timestamp": 1792220464, "like_count": 376769, "comment_count": 659, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/145.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1110930228071787a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 55.306, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr22-2.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQMgOLYxbx71voS0ARKylKZN18ZHm9r-iwdDWPrU00jtEwMcgETEcP6NRXR4SDXZNJ_vmhxjUpwcqvV671sJIUOT7sjtrOWiRgbiMXE.mp4?_nc_cat=109&_nc_oc=AdoWASpZA3o9-g1xPrRVfG2dUoLF74d_6fQ9WwnFErUSkhdPg2kNaJfijhw_csbPk8Q4NZEMFBgd40ue8So9eN8k&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr22-2.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=zcRsv0LK0IAQ7kNvwFbRvXd&%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=ZlXRS44IHdDISF6kKn_q8w&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQRSrp2vpzOfPYzVIa7SJTlB_N4gq6mZc8k8i2Bb0Q4y8g&oe=6AF409BA", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": tru